Z||000002||BOILERMAKER||07-06-99||07:59 AM||||I changed my SE from sunroof-less to one with a sunroof.  We had to change the whole top to one that had the sunroof hole already in it.  This was quite a task due to the fiberglass wanting to snap.  I also had changed the headliner to one from a sunroof fiero.  I have seen these headliners at the Fiero Store.  Good thing we had a sunroof fiero to use the parts from.
